      "summary_en": "Twitch becomes Camouflaged for a short duration and gains Move Speed. When leaving Camouflage, Twitch gains Attack Speed for a short duration. When an enemy champion with Deadly Venom dies, Ambush's cooldown is reset.",
      "summary_zh": "图奇进入伪装状态，持续一段短暂的时间并且移动速度得到提升。当离开伪装状态后，图奇会暂时获得攻击速度加成。 当一名身上带有【死亡毒液】的敌方英雄死亡时，此技能的冷却时间会重置。",
